{quote}AM can be in situation when soft churn is open for specific % of locations, while merchant already mentioned about plans to churn on all locations. does it make sense?{quote}

In this case, AM can go to “Log Churn” (or Intend to Churn - as we call it here), select all locations and save. If an account has logged churn manually for all locations (given that churn reasons and sub-reasons will be added through this log churn), then soft churn opportunity can be auto-closed by auto-populating the churn reasons added through log churn.

